Signal files in both languages (2026.11.13.20)

Raw sample encoding for the 18 SigMF datatypes and SigMF-layout recordings
(write_sigmf / read_sigmf, WriteSigmf / ReadSigmf), written from the format
description (ADR 0012, conventions: Signal files). 81 shared vectors from a
stdlib generator, with recordings in vectors/files. New cross-language check:
each language writes a recording per datatype and both read all of them.

Review fixes: complex values with an infinite part are now compared part by
part in both runners; C# reads JSON integers as long, not double.

